  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Grant and Technical Assistance for the Micro Lending for Climate Action and Environmental Protection Investments Programme in Kazakhstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The EIB will provide a credit line to a financial intermediary for financing sub-projects, for a total Bank Loan of up to USD 30 million. The Sub-Projects will be blended with the Incentive Grant financed from the EU Contribution. Eligible Sub-Projects would have a climate change-related and/or biodiversity and environment protection purpose. In addition, Technical Assistance will support capacity building of financial intermediary and Final Beneficiaries to streamline the Sub-Projects.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
